{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect custom "Company Overview & Stats" section based entirely on the visual layout, asymmetric balance, spacing, and copy structure shown in the reference image "image_6c5abb.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the active Shopify theme's typography family variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` layout wrappers), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop viewports, the layout splits into a 2-column horizontal grid. The left column takes up approximately 45% width (Company Profile Details List), and the right column takes up approximately 55% width (2x2 Stat Cards Grid).
    - **Mobile Fallback:** On mobile viewports, the columns must stack vertically, with the 2x2 stat grid sliding smoothly below the profile details list. 
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    
    ### 2. Left Column Layout (Company Profile Details List)
    - **Main Heading:** "Company Overview" 
      - Styling: Large, exceptionally bold, deep navy blue text (#0E2A3A) with clean letter-spacing.
    - **Profile Rows Stack:** A vertical stack of 4 information rows. Each row must use a horizontal flex layout consisting of:
      - **Icon Asset Box:** A small, soft-tinted muted olive-green square background icon box with smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 8px). Each box contains a clean, thin-line inline SVG icon corresponding to its row theme (e.g., building, globe, target/concentric circles, group/people).
      - **Text Cluster Panel:** A vertical text group positioned directly to the right of the icon containing:
        - **Label:** A small, muted slate-gray metadata label (e.g., "Company Name", "Headquarters").
        - **Value Copy:** Bold, dark navy blue text (#0E2A3A) for the actual data string.
    
    ### 3. Right Column Layout (2x2 Stat Cards Grid)
    - **Grid Structure:** A clean 2-column by 2-row CSS grid layout with a comfortable gap (approx. 20px) separating the cards.
    - **Stat Card Styling:** Each of the 4 cards must be designed with:
      - Background: An ultra-soft, light off-white/gray background card wash.
      - Border: A very faint, light-gray outer border stroke.
      - Shape: Soft rounded corners (border-radius: 12px).
      - Alignment: All text inside the card must be perfectly centered vertically and horizontally.
      - Text Elements:
        - **Big Number Stat:** Large, prominent, bold dark navy numbers/metrics (#0E2A3A).
        - **Stat Label:** Muted slate-gray explanatory text nested directly below the metric.
    
    ### 4. Exact Content Text Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the default section settings or schema blocks perfectly transcribe all text strings from image_6c5abb.png:
    
    #### LEFT COLUMN PROFILE ROWS:
    1. **Row 1:** - Label: Company Name
       - Value: Flow Solutions Inc.
    2. **Row 2:** - Label: Headquarters
       - Value: Tokyo, Japan
    3. **Row 3:** - Label: Founded
       - Value: 2019
    4. **Row 4:** - Label: Core Business
       - Value: Retail analytics and operational infrastructure for physical stores
    
    #### RIGHT COLUMN STAT CARDS GRID:
    - **Card 1 (Top Left):** - Metric: 500+
      - Label: Active Retail Locations
    - **Card 2 (Top Right):** - Metric: 50+
      - Label: Retail Brands
    - **Card 3 (Bottom Left):** - Metric: 98.5%
      - Label: Measurement Accuracy
    - **Card 4 (Bottom Right):** - Metric: 99.9%
      - Label: Platform Uptime SLA
    
    ### 5. Shopify Coding & Theme Schema Requirements
    - Make all titles, rows, labels, values, metrics, and cards completely dynamic and editable using structured `settings` and dynamic `blocks` inside the Liquid schema.
    - All custom CSS styles must be tightly scoped using the `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}` handle to guarantee absolutely zero layout or style leaking across your theme templates.
    - Ensure the 2x2 grid scales cleanly on tablet viewports without truncating text or overflowing its container.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--section-outer-spacing-inline, 24px);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 45% 55%;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-detail-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    background-color: #E8EBE0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    stroke: #6B7A5F;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-text-cluster-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #F8F9FA;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-company-overview-stat-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

